  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[E]\n[Am]\nI'm just a poor\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]\nwayfaring\nstranger\nTraveling through\n[Dm]\nthis world below\n[Am]\nThere is no sick-\nness,\nno toil, nor\ndanger\nIn that bright land\n[Dm]\n[E]to which I go\n[Am]\nI'm going there\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]\nto see my\n[C]Father\nAnd all my loved\n[F]ones\nwho've gone on\n[E]\nI'm just go-\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]\ning over Jor-\ndan\nI'm just go-\n[Dm]\n[E]ing over home\n[Am]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[E]\n[Am]\nI know dark clouds\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]\nwill gather a-\nround me\nI know my way\n[Dm]\nis hard and\n[Am]steep\nBut beauteous fields\narise be-\nfore me\nWhere God's redeemed,\n[Dm]\n[E]their vigils keep\n[Am]\nI'm going there\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]\nto see my\n[C]Mother\nShe said she'd meet\n[F]me\nwhen I come\n[E]\nSo, I'm just go-\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]\ning over Jor-\ndan\nI'm just go-\n[Dm]\n[E]ing over home\n[Am]\nI'm just go-\ning over Jor-\ndan\nI'm just go-\n[Dm]\n[E]ing over home\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]",
